							field is inert in this sketch (D-02); its job here is to show that the global
							scope costs a deliberate act and the per-screen scope does not.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<footer class="ds-atom-modal-ft">
					<Button variant="secondary">{fx.discardAll.cancelLabel}</Button>
					<Button variant="primary">{fx.discardAll.confirmLabel}</Button>
				</footer>
			</div>
		</div>
	)}

	{/* ══ O-pipeline-strip, FAILURE — D-15 ══════════════════════════════════
	    THE STRIP ITSELF IS IN THE TOPBAR, above, passed through the layout's
	    `pipeline` prop in its failure tone — so this route renders the SAME
	    region every other admin route carries, in the state D-15's contract copy
