			</div>

			<Card surface="subtle" padding="md" radius="lg">
				<div class="ov-pipe">
					<Eyebrow size="sm" tone="muted">THE OTHER PLACE, WHICH MUST AGREE</Eyebrow>
					<Text size="sm" tone="muted">
						D-15 puts pipeline state in two places: this strip, which survives navigation, and
						per-photo inline state on the affected tiles in the photos grid. Both name the same
						{" "}{fx.pipelineFailure.failed} photos, because a strip that says two while the grid
