					</Text>
					{/* Own row, same reason as the 401 cross-link above: a `Link` inside a
					    sentence measures 16px on every coarse-pointer class. */}
					<p class="ov-linkrow">
						<Link href="/admin/photos/" variant="inline">/admin/photos</Link>
					</p>
					<ul class="ov-changes">
						{fx.pipelineFailure.photos.map((p) => (
							<li>{p} — original still staged in R2, not processed</li>
						))}
					</ul>
					<Text size="sm" tone="muted">
						Retrying re-fires the dispatch against the staged originals. Nothing is uploaded
						again, so a retry on a phone costs a tap rather than the photographs.
					</Text>
				</div>
			</Card>
		</div>
	)}

	{/* ── Review band. NOT part of the design. ───────────────────────────── */}
	{o !== "index" && (
		<aside class="ov-review">
			<Eyebrow size="sm" tone="muted">REVIEW CHROME / NOT PART OF THE DESIGN</Eyebrow>
